{
  "topic": "Protective equipment requirements",
  "quote": "Closed-toe shoes are required in every work area. Tie back long hair before entering a machine zone. Safety glasses are required in the woodworking zone even when a member is observing. Hearing protection is required when the posted machine notice specifies it. The sewing station does not require safety glasses under this policy. These requirements do not replace machine induction."
}
